Monorepo for building Third Eye World — a voice-first, blind-first social network for blind/low-vision people (nonprofit, OSS, no ads; targets loneliness not engagement). Created 2026-07-19 at github.com/Taha-Mahmoodi/third-eye-world-mono (**private**, Taha's main account). So far only README + spec pointer pushed; nothing built yet.

Spec (source of truth) is the v2.0 paper on sadqi's account: [[third-eye-world-paper-v2-update]]. Delivery order per spec: web (Next.js) first, then native iOS + Android (E2EE DMs ship with the phone apps). Ten non-negotiable design principles gate every feature.

This is a fresh, deliberate start — NOT the earlier [[third-eye-world-build]] attempt that was scrapped for using the wrong source file. Repo owner is Taha-Mahmoodi, distinct from the sadqi paper repo; keep accounts separate per [[github-accounts]].
